# 3. Plotting
The following command produces a series of plots illustrating the equilibrium distributions, policy functions, and other relevant statistics. The plots are saved in the `figures/` directory.

```
include("plot_history_independent_tax.jl")
figs   = plot_history_independent_tax(result_run)

=== Figures saved ===
